    "updated_at": "2026-03-19T06:15:24Z",
    "body": "I remember another reason of no selection support was IDN.  It's hard  to map selection offsets to rendered text.\n\nFor example.\n`<input type=email value=\"foo@xn--japanese-xy4qg6h355l.com\">`\n\nUAs need to map `selectionStart` `selectionEnd` values for `foo@xn--japanese-xy4qg6h355l.com` to glyph offsets in `foo@日本語japanese.com`.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
